<title>DENMARK: Danish March new car yr/yr sales rose 0.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Danish March new car yr/yr sales rose 0.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish new car registrations rose 0.6 percent in March 1997 to 16,589 from 16,492 a year earlier, the Automobile Importers' Society said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				     March 1997   March 1996</p>
<p>    New car registrations	16,589     16,492</p>
<p>Leading March registrations by manufacturer</p>
<p>    Toyota		    2,049</p>
<p>    Ford Motor Co	   1,896</p>
<p>    Volkswagen AG	   1,736</p>
<p>    General Motors Corp   1,607</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen Newsroom, +45-33-969652</p>
</text>
